Z||000000||TRiAD||10-28-2001||10:00 PM||||OK, the dork on my local forum says the '88s don't have any differences form the old cars...<P><BR>Where do I find hard info on the changes to show him?<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Indiana_resto_guy||10-28-2001||10:06 PM||||Anywhere! Do you have a Haynes, Chiltons ot a Clymers handy? Just check out the suspension service stuff.||||reg||1
